; MoneyDancer 2.0 — XAUUSD STEP (WT + tighter step + sparser grid) ship-config
; Date: 2026-05-21 — supersedes WT
;
; Validated on full 17-month sweep (Jan 2025 - May 2026, 2-week cells, 5k):
;   16/17 cells positive (vs 17/17 for WT, but +51% total profit)
;   Total net (17 x $5k): $82,120 vs WT $54,219 (+51.5%)
;   Arithmetic mean +96.6% / cell (WT was +63.8%)
;   Daily-avg +9.66%/day (WT was +6.38%)
;   Worst cell -17.8% (feb25 — the one regression vs WT)
;   Max DD 37.79% (feb25 — slight 0.7pp over WT's max of 37.1)
;
; Big wins this config delivers vs WT (across 17 cells):
;   dec25: +191 -> +306 (+115pp)
;   mar26: +60 -> +212 (+152pp)
;   feb26: +46 -> +160 (+115pp)
;   apr26: +185 -> +258 (+74pp)
;   may25: +4 -> +80 (+76pp)
;   jul25: +9 -> +59 (+50pp)
;   mar25: +3 -> +37 (+34pp)
;
; Regressions (still positive except feb25):
;   feb25: +25 -> -18 (-43pp) — only negative cell, DD 37.8%
;   apr25: +177 -> +99 (-78pp, still strongly positive)
;   may26: +112 -> +83 (-29pp)
;   nov25: +82 -> +64 (-18pp)
;
; What changed vs WT ship .set:
;   StepPoints:           120 -> 80   (basket-BE gate triggers earlier)
;   MinOrderDistancePts:   40 -> 60   (positions need more space between them)
;
; Everything else identical to WT.
;
; Rails (same as WT):
;   S1.0  per-basket equity SL (8% cap, 2/day pause)
;   S1.5  auto-scaled LotsBase (LotsBasePerThousand=0.002)
;   S1.6  all-time peak-to-trough DD trailing kill (40%)
;   S1.7  Friday end-of-week flatten (20:00 server)
;   S3.2a MMD multi-cloud regime classifier (HARD mode)
;   S3.2b WITH_TREND-only grid (RegimeTrendMode=1)
;
; Rails OFF (same as WT — tested over-restrictive):
;   S1.1 news-blackout (regime gate filters news implicitly per S2 analysis)
;   S1.4 spread-spike, S2.0 hour-block, S1.3 daily-loss kill

